            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>names</code> dizisi üzerinde <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırma söz dizimini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"73\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>names.filter</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
