            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>[5, 10, 20].reduce((total, price) =&gt; total + price)</code> kodunu çalıştırıyorsun. Hangi değeri üretir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>35</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[5, 10, 20]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[10, 20, 40]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>35</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
